flowchart TB
    onprem[On-premises networks]
    dxvpn[Direct Connect gateway or Site-to-Site VPN]
    tgw[AWS Transit Gateway]

    subgraph workloads[Workload route domain]
        appa[Workload VPC A]
        appb[Workload VPC B]
    end

    subgraph shared[Shared-services route domain]
        svc[Shared-services VPC]
    end

    subgraph inspection[Inspection route domain]
        inspect[Inspection VPC: firewall or GWLB endpoints]
    end

    onprem --> dxvpn --> tgw
    appa <--> tgw
    appb <--> tgw
    svc <--> tgw
    inspect <--> tgw

    appa -. selected egress or east-west flows .-> inspect
    appb -. selected egress or east-west flows .-> inspect
    inspect -. symmetric return path required .-> tgw

    note[Conceptual study diagram only\nEach attachment is associated with one TGW route table.\nVPC route tables, security controls, and DNS design remain separate.]
